1
00:00:00,315 --> 00:00:03,605
(Howard:)She hugged you? How did she hug you?

2
00:00:11,493 --> 00:00:13,953
(Howard:)Is that her perfume I smell?

3
00:00:15,289 --> 00:00:17,289
(Raj:)Intoxicating, isn't it?

4
00:00:33,766 --> 00:00:36,436
(Leonard:)- Hi.
- Oh.

5
00:00:37,102 --> 00:00:38,142
(Penny:)What's going on?

6
00:00:39,146 --> 00:00:40,356
(Leonard:)Uh...

7
00:00:40,522 --> 00:00:42,482
Here's the thing:

8
00:00:46,528 --> 00:00:52,578
"Penny, just as Oppenheimer came to regret
his contributions to the first atomic bomb...

9
00:00:52,743 --> 00:00:54,993
(Leonard:)...so too I regret my participation
in what was...

10
00:00:55,162 --> 00:00:57,952
...at the very least, an error in judgment.

11
00:00:58,999 --> 00:01:01,169
(Leonard:)The hallmark
of the great human experiment...

